### 04. Roster & Attendance API Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "angel@unggul.co.id",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Get All Rosters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rosters/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Export Roster File
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rosters/jul/export
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Attendance Today
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/today
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Record Check-In
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nik": "503264133",
  "machine": "FP-01 · Office"
}

### Record Check-Out
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nik": "503264133",
  "machine": "FP-01 · Office"
}
